ciResDeg -- compute a regularity index and partial degrees of the residual resultant over a complete intersection
*****************************************************************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        ciResDeg(List, List)
  * Inputs:
      * d, a *note list: (Macaulay2Doc)List,, a list of element in the ambient
        ring corresponding to the degrees of a system of polynomials
        $d_0,...,d_n$
      * k, a *note list: (Macaulay2Doc)List,, a list of element in the ambient
        ring corresponding to the degrees of a complete intersection
        $k_1,...,k_m$, where m=<n
  * Outputs:
      * List, a *note list: (Macaulay2Doc)List,, a list of element consisting
        of a regularity index and partial degree of homogeneity

Description
===========


 Given a system of polynomials $f_0,...,f_n$ of degree $d_0,...,d_n$ that are
contained in a complete intersection $g_1,...,g_m$ of degree $k_1,...,k_m$,
this function returns the regularity index used to form the matrix associated
to the residual resultant over a complete intersection and then all the partial
degrees of this resultant with respect to the coefficients of $f_0,f_1,..,f_n$.
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : R=ZZ[d_0..d_3,k_1,k_2]                                                  |
|                                                                             |
|o1 = R                                                                       |
|                                                                             |
|o1 : PolynomialRing                                                          |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : L=ciResDeg({d_0,d_1,d_2,d_3},{k_1,k_2})                                 |
|                                                                             |
|                                                                         2   |
|o2 = {d  + d  + d  + d  - 3k  - 3, {d d d  - d k k  - d k k  - d k k  + k k  |
|       0    1    2    3     2        1 2 3    1 1 2    2 1 2    3 1 2    1 2 |
|     ------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|          2                                       2        2                 |
|     + k k , d d d  - d k k  - d k k  - d k k  + k k  + k k , d d d  - d k k |
|        1 2   0 2 3    0 1 2    2 1 2    3 1 2    1 2    1 2   0 1 3    0 1 2|
|     ------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|                          2        2                                         |
|     - d k k  - d k k  + k k  + k k , d d d  - d k k  - d k k  - d k k  +    |
|        1 1 2    3 1 2    1 2    1 2   0 1 2    0 1 2    1 1 2    2 1 2      |
|     ------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|      2        2                                                             |
|     k k  + k k }}                                                           |
|      1 2    1 2                                                             |
|                                                                             |
|o2 : List                                                                    |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+

