detComplex -- This function calculates the determinant of a graded Complex with respect to a subset of the variables of the polynomial ring in a fixed degree.
**************************************************************************************************************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        deteriminantComplex = detComplex(d,v,C)
  * Inputs:
      * c, an *note integer: (Macaulay2Doc)ZZ,, integer corresponding to the
        degree of the strand of the chain complex.
      * v, a *note list: (Macaulay2Doc)List,, list of variables of the
        polynomial ring R to take into account for elimination
      * C, a *note complex: (Complexes)Complex,, a chain complex of free
        modules over a polynomial ring
  * *note Optional inputs: (Macaulay2Doc)using functions with optional inputs,:
      * *note Strategy: detComplex_lp_pd_pd_pd_cmStrategy=>_pd_pd_pd_rp, =>
        ..., default value null, choose between Exact and Numeric algorithms
  * Outputs:
      * aPolynomialList, a *note list: (Macaulay2Doc)List,, an element in
        frac(R) that is the alternate product of the elements in the list
        'listDetComplex'

Description
===========


This function calculates the determinant of a graded Complex with respect to a
subset of the variables of the polynomial ring in a fixed degree. It
corresponds to the alternate product of the elements in the list *note
listDetComplex: listDetComplex,


The input Complex needs to be an exact complex of free modules over a
polynomial ring. The polynomial ring must contain the list v as variables.


It is recommended not to defines rings as R=QQ[x,y][a,b,c] when the variables
to eliminate are '{x,y}'. In this case, see *note flattenRing:
(Macaulay2Doc)flattenRing, for passing from $R=QQ[x,y][a,b,c]$ to
QQ[x,y,a,b,c].
+--------------------------------------------+
|i1 : R=QQ[a,b,c,x,y]                        |
|                                            |
|o1 = R                                      |
|                                            |
|o1 : PolynomialRing                         |
+--------------------------------------------+
|i2 : f1 = a*x^2+b*x*y+c*y^2                 |
|                                            |
|        2              2                    |
|o2 = a*x  + b*x*y + c*y                     |
|                                            |
|o2 : R                                      |
+--------------------------------------------+
|i3 : f2 = 2*a*x+b*y                         |
|                                            |
|o3 = 2a*x + b*y                             |
|                                            |
|o3 : R                                      |
+--------------------------------------------+
|i4 : M = matrix{{f1,f2}}                    |
|                                            |
|o4 = | ax2+bxy+cy2 2ax+by |                 |
|                                            |
|             1      2                       |
|o4 : Matrix R  <-- R                        |
+--------------------------------------------+
|i5 : l = {x,y}                              |
|                                            |
|o5 = {x, y}                                 |
|                                            |
|o5 : List                                   |
+--------------------------------------------+
|i6 : dHPM = detComplex (2,l,koszulComplex M)|
|                                            |
|          2     2                           |
|o6 = - a*b  + 4a c                          |
|                                            |
|o6 : frac R                                 |
+--------------------------------------------+
|i7 : dHPM = detComplex (3,l,koszulComplex M)|
|                                            |
|          2     2                           |
|o7 = - a*b  + 4a c                          |
|                                            |
|o7 : frac R                                 |
+--------------------------------------------+
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i8 : R=QQ[a,b,c,d,e,f,g,h,i,x,y,z]                                |
|                                                                  |
|o8 = R                                                            |
|                                                                  |
|o8 : PolynomialRing                                               |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i9 : f1 = a*x+b*y+c*z                                             |
|                                                                  |
|o9 = a*x + b*y + c*z                                              |
|                                                                  |
|o9 : R                                                            |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i10 : f2 = d*x+e*y+f*z                                            |
|                                                                  |
|o10 = d*x + e*y + f*z                                             |
|                                                                  |
|o10 : R                                                           |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i11 : f3 = g*x+h*y+i*z                                            |
|                                                                  |
|o11 = g*x + h*y + i*z                                             |
|                                                                  |
|o11 : R                                                           |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i12 : M = matrix{{f1,f2,f3}}                                      |
|                                                                  |
|o12 = | ax+by+cz dx+ey+fz gx+hy+iz |                              |
|                                                                  |
|              1      3                                            |
|o12 : Matrix R  <-- R                                             |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i13 : l = {x,y,z}                                                 |
|                                                                  |
|o13 = {x, y, z}                                                   |
|                                                                  |
|o13 : List                                                        |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i14 : dHPM = detComplex (1,l,koszulComplex M)                     |
|                                                                  |
|o14 = - c*e*g + b*f*g + c*d*h - a*f*h - b*d*i + a*e*i             |
|                                                                  |
|o14 : frac R                                                      |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i15 : dHPM = detComplex (2,l,koszulComplex M)                     |
|                                                                  |
|o15 = - c*e*g + b*f*g + c*d*h - a*f*h - b*d*i + a*e*i             |
|                                                                  |
|o15 : frac R                                                      |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i16 : dHPM = detComplex (1,l,koszulComplex M, Strategy => Exact)  |
|                                                                  |
|o16 = - c*e*g + b*f*g + c*d*h - a*f*h - b*d*i + a*e*i             |
|                                                                  |
|o16 : frac R                                                      |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i17 : dHPM = detComplex (1,l,koszulComplex M, Strategy => Numeric)|
|                                                                  |
|o17 = - c*e*g + b*f*g + c*d*h - a*f*h - b*d*i + a*e*i             |
|                                                                  |
|o17 : frac R                                                      |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+

